{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6f7addf9976fd98b41776a2521a223d88671cdb4a55f76f2096f8b0a8ba0ce70",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f06853b2826c833850b9f3bfa159a8b6e57d97966931d963f0822465255c7ec8",
      "text": "点燃干劲之火",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71aa94baff86cd821bd7c6825442feb011669b3fbf9dbbab1631e14024c4611a",
      "text": "这首歌，真超级棒啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea38102fa8138a95372836284bde22a96565c99589403f390ea4ccd1a018dc78",
      "text": "啊啊。\n很期待由我们来唱会是什么效果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fba36aaa6da79447e3749841b4ee86e9cfae995ac64655dae66a855db0ae0e38",
      "text": "歌词和分段分配，\n也都很适合各自的组合呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfde8b461633568e515f0aa0c9178cecf5e0914922bdd6fde4d00b14c7d8f4b4",
      "text": "这部分在演唱会上也是FRAME的亮点，\n看来有必要在表现力上下下功夫啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ca4859807673554c6a49e2fe18c055c57ff0a2dc631b971346de7dcee6b854e",
      "text": "对了。Beit说明天想商量\n演出的事对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15890b91ae3ce110f09d221f3adc5e72648fe861d4c571b355c223b993adb582",
      "text": "在那之前稍微想出点方案的话，\n配合起演出效果不是也更顺畅吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd9e17fb865e8723127f293d7f79825148bb3e22acb1fe63bb887ce6ba83a5a",
      "text": "原来如此……！今天之内还能抽出时间\n来讨论吗？虽然之后还有练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fbeaa824526d52a7bc4ea37094c3ef9dcb653b32c40a096c904b02ab587c423",
      "text": "既然这样，练习之后再额外抽点时间吧。\n前提是排练室还空着就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_006_22_5_06_006_22:5_06_006_22:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8dff5c36b48c3906a425617b14e9c6f54d283e3ba0e862fe3175e8605fa12bf",
      "text": "好的！\n我们赶紧去向制作人确认吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
